    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a088m9n",
      "content": "Uttarakhand is a state of the Indian Union under the Uttaranchal (Formation) Act, 2000, passed by Parliament. It is the 27th state of India. The state has a unicameral legislature — Uttarakhand Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha). There is no upper house (Vidhan Parishad)."
    },
